#: ../../getting_started/guides/op_workflows.rst:42
msgid ""
"Inputs are custom input fields which can be added to Layouts, Instance "
"Types, Workflows, and other constructs in |morpheus|. The input can be "
"consumed as variables within templates and scripts. In this case, the "
"Inputs will be associated with our Operational Workflow. We will create "
"three so the user can define a name for the new Group and optionally "
"provide a code and/or location value if desired."
msgstr ""
"Inputs are personalizado input fields which puede agregarse to Layouts, "
"Instance Types, Workflows, y otros constructs in |morpheus|. The input "
"puede ser consumed as variables dentro de templates y scripts. In this "
"case, the Inputs será asociado con our Operational Workflow. We will "
"create three so el usuario can define a name for the nuevo Group y "
"optionally provide a code and/or location value if desired."

