#: ../../getting_started/guides/op_workflows.rst:97
msgid "Create Operational Workflow"
msgstr "Create Operational Workflow"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/op_workflows.rst:99
msgid ""
"|morpheus| Workflows pull multiple Tasks together into a logical group. "
"There are two types of Workflows: Operational and Provisioning. "
"Provisioning Workflows (which aren't used in this guide) are associated "
"with an Instance at provision time and will automatically run the "
"appropriate Tasks when the Instance reaches certain phases of its "
"lifecycle, such as during provisioning, teardown, startup, or shutdown. "
"In our case, we need an Operational Workflow which are run on-demand when"
" needed or on timed intervals."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| Workflows pull multiple Tasks together into a logical group. "
"There are two types of Workflows: Operational y Provisioning. "
"Provisioning Workflows (which aren't used in this guide) are asociado con"
" an Instance at provision time y will automatically run the appropriate "
"Tasks when the Instance reaches certain phases of its lifecycle, como "
"durante provisioning, teardown, startup, o shutdown. In our case, we need"
" an Operational Workflow which are run on-demand when needed o on timed "
"intervals."

